1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,191
The hardest discharge question can arrive after the patient gets home.

2
00:00:04,574 --> 00:00:08,916
A caregiver has an old medicine bottle, a new discharge sheet, and

3
00:00:08,975 --> 00:00:10,902
a test result still to come.

4
00:00:11,285 --> 00:00:15,116
The family needs to understand the changes while helping someone recover.

5
00:00:15,627 --> 00:00:21,212
Which instruction needs clarification, and who owns the next step?

6
00:00:22,024 --> 00:00:25,275
Atropos MedPlain brings those questions into one review.

7
00:00:25,716 --> 00:00:29,907
In this synthetic prototype, you bring the original documents and the
caregiver's

8
00:00:29,953 --> 00:00:31,033
concern together.

9
00:00:31,358 --> 00:00:36,803
Strands coordinates agents that index the evidence, connect relevant
passages, and build

10
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:38,951
an inspectable clarification card.

11
00:00:39,392 --> 00:00:44,431
In another retained case, it linked a caregiver's "heart pill" and "XL"

12
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:48,378
to source passages that raised an identity or formulation question.

13
00:00:48,761 --> 00:00:52,593
Deterministic rules preserve the supported clinical facts throughout.

14
00:00:53,034 --> 00:00:56,668
The review screen separates mandatory checks from AI proposals.

15
00:00:56,993 --> 00:01:00,441
Each question points back to its sources, so the care team can

16
00:01:00,487 --> 00:01:03,599
inspect the evidence and decide what needs clarification.

17
00:01:03,924 --> 00:01:08,336
The card keeps the original wording and leaves the medication regimen
unresolved,

18
00:01:08,463 --> 00:01:10,391
with the decision in human hands.

19
00:01:11,087 --> 00:01:14,315
The safety gate then checks what can reach the patient.

20
00:01:14,826 --> 00:01:19,365
In an earlier test, we deliberately changed a pressure condition after
generation.

21
00:01:19,748 --> 00:01:24,834
The gate refused it, and Strands sent the work through fresh verification
and correction.

22
00:01:25,437 --> 00:01:27,968
Linked receipts retain both outcomes.

23
00:01:28,351 --> 00:01:31,555
If verification cannot finish, the card stays withheld.

24
00:01:32,159 --> 00:01:35,596
A complex card reaches the public view only after review of that

25
00:01:35,642 --> 00:01:36,838
exact artifact.

26
00:01:37,349 --> 00:01:40,971
Patients can choose larger text or start local device speech.

27
00:01:41,668 --> 00:01:47,124
Bounded English or Greek questions appear alongside unchanged original
quotations.

28
00:01:47,565 --> 00:01:52,534
This release displays teach-back prompts; patient responses are not
assessed in the

29
00:01:52,569 --> 00:01:53,811
deployed application.

30
00:01:54,137 --> 00:01:55,704
The results are mixed.

31
00:01:56,145 --> 00:02:01,811
On thirty known synthetic cases, the agents found nine annotated
relationships versus

32
00:02:01,904 --> 00:02:04,923
four for the full baseline, with higher precision.

33
00:02:05,201 --> 00:02:09,439
They delivered twenty-five cards, and five refusals remained.

34
00:02:09,764 --> 00:02:14,652
The latest diagnostic also stopped after one verified card and one
refusal,

35
00:02:14,931 --> 00:02:17,055
leaving its comparison unrun.

36
00:02:17,659 --> 00:02:20,608
We publish those limits alongside the successes.

37
00:02:20,991 --> 00:02:22,825
Clinical benefit is unmeasured.

38
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:27,481
Try the anonymous demo, trace a card back to its sources, and

39
00:02:27,690 --> 00:02:29,954
inspect the complete evidence.
